\title{pkginspectr: Tidy Tools for Inspecting and Comparing R Package Structure}
\description{
Inspect the structure and source code of R packages from local folders, 'GitHub' repositories or 'CRAN'. Summarise file counts, folder structure and lines of code (blank, comment, 'roxygen', function and test lines) as tidy tibbles. Lines are classified with R's own parser, and files excluded by '.Rbuildignore' are skipped, so local folders and released packages can be compared on equal terms. Compare several packages side by side and visualise the results as Unicode bar charts in the console.
